      "id": "claim_bbdb117eadec4c4294f4c6064bd12d7c",
      "statement": "migrateLegacyDir performs a one-time os.Rename (not a copy) of a legacy ~/.any-ai-cli directory to ~/.many-ai-cli only when the new directory does not yet exist; it silently no-ops on any stat/rename failure and startup continues regardless.",
