    {
      "id": "claim_e240669bcf3046adb0fe6787af08457c",
      "statement": "Config.Clone() performs a deep copy that individually copies map and slice fields so the clone can be passed to Save without holding the caller's config mutex, avoiding a concurrent-map-iteration panic during yaml.Marshal if the live config is mutated concurrently.",
