    {
      "id": "claim_96cc2d08124247b0b170a15a3a9cd409",
      "statement": "user_prefs.display.custom_themes is sanitized server-side on PUT /api/user-prefs: SanitizeCustomThemes drops entries with invalid or duplicate u- ids or empty names, clamps hue to 0-359 and contrast to 0-100, and caps the list at 20, then SanitizeDisplayTheme falls the active theme back to light when it names a custom id that no longer exists.",
